<p>
    Pick the setting that fits how you want to play.
</p>

<h3>Single Player Only Options</h3>
<p>
    Play on this device. You can play by yourself, play against the
    computer, or take turns with other people on the same device.
    Each game has its own choices.
</p>

<h3>Host Game Only</h3>
<p>
    You choose the game. Other people join you from their own devices.
    Choose a game, then start hosting or continue a saved game.
    Wait for the other players to join.
</p>

<h3>All Game Options</h3>
<p>
    See all the ways you can play each game.
    You can play on this device, host a game, or join a game.
    You choose how to play after you pick a game.
</p>

<h3>Let Host Choose Game</h3>
<p>
    Let someone else choose the game. You do not pick a game here.
    You will see the game names, but you cannot tap them to choose one.
</p>
<p>
    You can look at the list and tell the host which game you would
    like to play. This screen does not send messages to the host.
</p>

<h3>Join Specific Game Only</h3>
<p>
    Pick the game you want to join. Then join someone who is hosting
    that game. You and the host must choose the same game.
</p>